  "identifier": "volview",
  "name": "VolView",
  "description": "Open-source browser-based 3D radiological viewer for DICOM data with interactive cinematic volume rendering. All processing runs locally in the browser — no software installation required and no data leaves the user's machine. Supports drag-and-drop DICOM loading, three cinematic rendering modes with lighting controls, annotation tools (painting, measuring, cropping), and GPU acceleration with CPU fallback. Customisable for commercial and academic deployments. Live instance at volview.kitware.app. Published at MICCAI 2022 AE-CAI Workshop. NIH-funded (NIBIB, NIGMS, NCI, NINDS). v4.4.0, 283 stars, TypeScript/Vue, Apache-2.0. Kitware.",
  "url": "https://volview.kitware.app/",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/Kitware/VolView",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
